        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 89ecbd36-92a5-49f4-bf3e-ad4dcd11866f).Image",
        "Description": "47, this is a bit of an odd one. Our client, a recent murder victim, was being hunted down when they called up the ICA and requested the contract. They pre-paid a very hefty sum of money to make sure the contract goes through, so to keep our reputation safe, we&apos;re going through with it. All they managed to say was &quot;Himmapan Hotel...Their name is Jack-&quot; before the call disconnected. We haven&apos;t been able to collect any additional information, so...just to be sure...",
